---
import DormSketch from './DormSketch.astro';
---
<div class="dreame-story container">
  <div class="project-context">
    <span>Marketing & PR Intern</span><span>U.S. team · Summer 2025</span>
    <span>Creonix · Instagram · Meltwater · Canva</span>
  </div>

  <div class="output-strip" aria-label="My contributions">
    <div><strong>40+</strong><span>nano-creators screened</span></div>
    <div><strong>8</strong><span>creators seeded with product</span></div>
    <div><strong>4</strong><span>social campaign phases proposed</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="scope-note"><span class="status-dot"></span>Creator seeding ran. Social concepts were proposed, then shelved during a team restructuring. Reach and sales results are unavailable.</p>

  <section class="story-section" aria-labelledby="dreame-audiences">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="micro">01 / the insight</span><h2 id="dreame-audiences">The buyer isn’t always the user.</h2></div>
    <div class="audience-grid">
      <div class="audience-card parent">
        <div class="audience-top"><span class="micro">Parents · the buyers</span><span class="audience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
        <h3>Make the school-year reset easier.</h3>
        <div class="audience-bottom"><span>Practical value + time saved</span><strong>Parenting creators</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="audience-card student">
        <div class="audience-top"><span class="micro">Students · the users</span><span class="audience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div>
        <h3>Make this small space feel like mine.</h3>
        <div class="audience-bottom"><span>Dorm life + relatable routines</span><strong>Memes, carousels & student offers</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="short-take">My approach: give parents a practical reason to buy, and students a reason to care.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section" aria-labelledby="dreame-creators">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="micro">02 / what shipped</span><h2 id="dreame-creators">Fit before follower count.</h2></div>
    <div class="creator-board">
      <div class="creator-step"><span class="micro">Discovery</span><strong>40+</strong><span>creators screened</span><small>AI-assisted search + manual Instagram research</small></div>
      <div class="creator-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <div class="creator-step selected"><span class="micro">Product seeding</span><strong>8</strong><span>creators received a G10</span><small>Manager-approved shortlist · product in exchange for content</small></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="criteria" aria-label="Creator selection criteria"><li>Student or parenting content</li><li>Under 10K followers</li><li>Real conversation in comments</li></ul>
    <p class="short-take">I also wrote each creator’s campaign brief within Dreame’s brand template: offer, product, themes, and deliverables.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section" aria-labelledby="dreame-creative">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="micro">03 / the proposed creative</span><h2 id="dreame-creative">From “that’s my dorm” to “that’s my deal.”</h2></div>
    <p class="reconstruction-note">Original portfolio reconstructions of my proposed concepts. These are illustrative mockups, not published Dreame campaign assets.</p>
    <div class="concept-grid">
      <article class="concept-card">
        <div class="mockup dorm-meme" aria-label="Illustrative dorm realities meme concept">
          <div class="mock-kicker">DORM REALITIES</div>
          <div class="meme-pair"><div><span>move-in day</span><DormSketch /></div><div><span>one week later</span><DormSketch messy /></div></div>
          <div class="mock-punchline">Tiny room.<br />Big mess.</div>
          <span class="mock-mark">01 / recognize the problem</span>
        </div>
        <div class="concept-caption"><span class="micro">Pre-heat · meme grid</span><h3>Dorm Realities vs. Dreame Solutions</h3><p>Make the problem instantly recognizable.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="concept-card">
        <div class="mockup main-character" aria-label="Illustrative main character cleaning concept">
          <span class="mock-kicker">MAIN CHARACTER ENERGY</span>
          <div class="mock-display">Your room.<br />Your reset.</div>
          <DormSketch cleaning />
          <span class="scribble">a little less chaos ↗</span>
          <span class="mock-mark">02 / make the solution feel good</span>
        </div>
        <div class="concept-caption"><span class="micro">Launch · carousel + doodle poster</span><h3>Main Character Cleaning</h3><p>Turn cleaning into an appealing routine.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="concept-card">
        <div class="mockup survival-kit" aria-label="Illustrative dorm survival kit carousel cover">
          <span class="mock-kicker">SAVE FOR MOVE-IN</span>
          <div class="mock-display">The dorm<br />survival kit.</div>
          <svg class="kit-drawing" viewBox="0 0 360 150" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M26 43L76 33L91 111L41 121ZM38 56L65 50M42 67L70 61M135 116V65H182V116ZM139 64L147 36H171L179 64M145 35V26H173V35M222 119L230 96H273L281 119ZM235 96V79M231 82Q212 61 228 54Q243 49 246 76Q248 41 263 48Q281 56 252 81M305 114V42H338V114ZM316 49H328M318 106H326"/><path d="M104 29V43M97 36H111M292 57V67M287 62H297"/></svg>
          <span class="mock-mark">03 / earn saves & shares</span>
        </div>
        <div class="concept-caption"><span class="micro">Engagement · UGC-style carousel</span><h3>Dorm Survival Kit</h3><p>Give students something useful to save.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="concept-card">
        <div class="mockup student-deal" aria-label="Illustrative student-ID offer poster concept, not a current offer">
          <span class="mock-kicker">STUDENT DEAL DAYS</span>
          <span class="deal-extra">EXTRA</span><strong class="deal-number">10<span>%</span></strong>
          <span class="deal-detail">off with student ID</span>
          <span class="deal-ticket">small space. smarter start. ↗</span>
          <span class="mock-mark">04 / give interest a next step</span>
        </div>
        <div class="concept-caption"><span class="micro">Conversion · student-ID poster</span><h3>Student Deal Days</h3><p>Connect the creative to a concrete offer.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="scope-note">Sample copy and original illustrations created for this portfolio. The historical offer is shown as part of an unlaunched concept; it is not a current promotion.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section outcome" aria-labelledby="dreame-outcome">
    <span class="micro">the honest outcome</span><h2 id="dreame-outcome">An executed seeding program.<br />A proposed social journey.</h2>
    <p>My internship ended before the creator posts went live. I can show the selection work and creative thinking, but cannot claim reach, conversions, or sales lift.</p>
    <div class="next-test"><span class="micro">What I’d test next</span><p>Give each creator a unique code or tracked link, then compare conversion—not just content output.</p></div>
  </section>

  <details class="press-details">
    <summary><span><span class="micro">Optional deeper dive</span><strong>What the press data changed</strong></span><span class="details-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
    <div class="press-content">
      <p class="press-lead">The coverage favored deals and product proof.</p>
      <div class="press-bars" aria-label="My categorization of nine Dreame headlines from the August 1, 2025 weekly report">
        {[{label:'Deals & price drops',n:3},{label:'Reviews & tests',n:3},{label:'Best-of roundups',n:2},{label:'Market news',n:1},{label:'Seasonal campaigns',n:0}].map(row=><div class="press-row"><span>{row.label}</span><span class="press-track"><span style={`width:${row.n / 9 * 100}%`}></span></span><strong>{row.n}</strong></div>)}
      </div>
      <p class="scope-note">9 headlines · week of Aug 1, 2025 · my categorization. This snapshot does not establish why individual pitches received few replies.</p>
      <div class="supporting-copy"><slot /></div>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>

<style>
  .dreame-story { max-width: 1120px; }
  .project-context { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px 24px; font:11px/1.6 var(--font-mono); color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:28px; }
  .output-strip { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); border:var(--border); background:var(--block-dreame); }
  .output-strip > div { padding:28px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; border-right:var(--rule); }
  .output-strip > div:last-child { border:0; }
  .output-strip strong { font:650 clamp(40px,5vw,64px)/1 var(--font-display); }
  .output-strip span { font:12px/1.5 var(--font-mono); max-width:23ch; }
  .scope-note { margin:16px 0 0; color:var(--muted); font:11px/1.65 var(--font-mono); }
  .status-dot { display:inline-block; width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent); margin-right:7px; }
  .story-section { margin-top:80px; }
  .story-heading { margin-bottom:24px; max-width:750px; }
  .story-heading .micro { display:block; margin-bottom:12px; }
  h2 { font-size:clamp(28px,3.3vw,40px); line-height:1.15; text-wrap:pretty; }
  .audience-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:20px; }
  .audience-card { border:var(--border); padding:28px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:24px; }
  .parent { background:#F9E8DB; } .student { background:#E9E2F7; }
  .audience-top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px; }
  .audience-symbol { font:40px/1 var(--font-display); }
  .audience-card h3 { font-size:clamp(24px,2.5vw,30px); max-width:18ch; line-height:1.2; }
  .audience-bottom { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; font-size:12px; margin-top:auto; }
  .short-take { font-size:13px; max-width:75ch; margin:20px 0 0; }
  .creator-board { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 60px minmax(0,1fr); border:var(--border); background:var(--surface); padding:32px; align-items:center; }
  .creator-step { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; }
  .creator-step strong { font:650 72px/1 var(--font-display); letter-spacing:-.04em; }
  .creator-step > span:not(.micro) { font-size:14px; }
  .creator-step small { color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; max-width:29ch; }
  .creator-arrow { font-size:32px; }
  .creator-step.selected strong { background:var(--block-dreame); padding:8px 22px; border-radius:50%; transform:rotate(-8deg); }
  .criteria { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; list-style:none; margin:16px 0 0; padding:0; gap:8px; }
  .criteria li { border:var(--rule); padding:6px 10px; font-size:11px; }
  .reconstruction-note { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); max-width:80ch; margin:0 0 24px; }
  .concept-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:32px 24px; }
  .concept-card { min-width:0; }
  .mockup { position:relative; height:352px; padding:24px; border:var(--border); overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
  .mock-kicker { font:10px/1.4 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.10em; }
  .mock-mark { font:9px/1.4 var(--font-mono); margin-top:auto; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; }
  .dorm-meme { background:#F7DE69; }
  .meme-pair { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:8px; margin-top:16px; }
  .meme-pair > div { border:var(--rule); background:var(--paper); }
  .meme-pair span { display:block; padding:5px; border-bottom:var(--rule); font-size:9px; text-align:center; }
  .meme-pair :global(svg) { display:block; width:100%; }
  .mock-punchline { font:650 clamp(32px,3.7vw,46px)/1 var(--font-display); margin-top:18px; letter-spacing:-.03em; }
  .main-character { background:#DED3F3; }
  .mock-display { font:650 clamp(30px,3.4vw,42px)/1.04 var(--font-display); letter-spacing:-.025em; margin-top:18px; }
  .main-character :global(svg) { position:absolute; width:72%; right:8px; bottom:39px; }
  .scribble { position:absolute; font:italic 15px/1.2 Georgia,serif; transform:rotate(-10deg); left:24px; bottom:65px; max-width:12ch; }
  .survival-kit { background:#DCE9DB; }
  .kit-drawing { width:100%; margin:auto 0; }
  .student-deal { background:#F4C7B5; align-items:center; text-align:center; }
  .student-deal .mock-kicker { border-bottom:var(--rule); width:100%; padding-bottom:12px; }
  .deal-extra { font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.15em; margin-top:18px; }
  .deal-number { font:650 112px/.95 var(--font-display); letter-spacing:-.07em; }
  .deal-number span { font-size:60px; }
  .deal-detail { font:600 22px/1.3 var(--font-display); }
  .deal-ticket { border:var(--rule); padding:7px 12px; transform:rotate(-4deg); font-size:10px; margin-top:20px; background:var(--paper); }
  .concept-caption { padding:16px 0 0; }
  .concept-caption .micro { font-size:10px; }
  .concept-caption h3 { font-size:23px; line-height:1.2; margin:8px 0; max-width:26ch; }
  .concept-caption p { font-size:12px; margin:0; }
  .outcome { border-left:4px solid var(--block-dreame); padding-left:28px; }
  .outcome h2 { margin:12px 0 20px; }
  .outcome > p { max-width:75ch; font-size:13px; }
  .next-test { background:#EFEAF7; padding:20px 24px; margin-top:24px; }
  .next-test p { font-size:13px; margin:8px 0 0; max-width:75ch; }
  .press-details { margin:64px 0 0; border:var(--border); background:var(--surface); }
  summary { padding:22px 24px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; align-items:center; cursor:pointer; list-style:none; min-height:72px; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  summary > span:first-child { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; }
  summary strong { font:600 23px/1.2 var(--font-display); }
  .details-plus { font:28px/1 var(--font-mono); }
  details[open] .details-plus { transform:rotate(45deg); }
  .press-content { padding:0 24px 28px; }
  .press-lead { font:600 26px/1.2 var(--font-display); padding-top:24px; border-top:var(--rule); }
  .press-bars { display:grid; gap:12px; margin:24px 0; }
  .press-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(140px,1fr) minmax(0,2fr) 18px; gap:16px; align-items:center; font-size:12px; }
  .press-track { height:12px; background:#F2EFE9; }
  .press-track > span { display:block; height:100%; background:var(--block-dreame); }
  .press-row:last-child strong { color:var(--accent); }
  .supporting-copy :global(h3) { font-size:22px; margin:28px 0 12px; }
  .supporting-copy :global(p) { font-size:13px; max-width:80ch; }
  @media(max-width:699px) {
    .project-context { font-size:10px; gap:6px 16px; }
    .output-strip > div { padding:18px 12px; }
    .output-strip span { font-size:10px; }
    .output-strip strong { font-size:40px; }
    .story-section { margin-top:56px; }
    .audience-grid,.concept-grid { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); }
    .audience-card { padding:24px; }
    .creator-board { padding:24px 18px; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 32px minmax(0,1fr); gap:8px; }
    .creator-step strong { font-size:54px; }
    .creator-step .micro { font-size:9px; }
    .creator-step > span:not(.micro) { font-size:11px; }
    .creator-step small { font-size:10px; }
    .creator-arrow { font-size:24px; }
    .creator-step.selected strong { padding:6px 16px; }
    .mockup { height:340px; }
    .outcome { padding-left:20px; }
    .press-row { grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr) 14px; gap:10px; font-size:10px; }
    summary { padding:20px; } .press-content { padding:0 20px 24px; }
    summary strong { font-size:21px; }
  }
</style>
